-- ============================================================================
-- Migration 585: Seed "Standard Press" -- a real, previously-missing
-- machine_library.json category (16 machines staged; only 4 genuinely new)
--
-- Context: source is uploaded Standard Press fleet screenshots. Flattened to
-- this file's established convention (labor_rate_usd_per_hr ->
-- labor_rate_usd_hr, press_force_kN -> press_force_kn, machine_power_kW ->
-- machine_power_kw, machine_uptime_factor_pct -> machine_uptime_pct,
-- supplies_cost_usd_per_yr -> supplies_cost_usd_yr, and
-- constant_coefficient_handling_time / mass_coefficient_handling_time_s_per_kg
-- -> const_coeff_handling_time / mass_coeff_handling_time_s_kg, matching the
-- exact field names Progressive Die Press already uses for the identical
-- concept). primary_id and wage_grade_name are null in the source -- left
-- null, not invented.
--
-- DUPLICATE CHECK (done before writing this, live 2026-08-27): 12 of the 16
-- machines (Default Press, Schuler 1150 Ton, Schuler A2/200 - 360, Schuler
-- TSD 2000, and all 8 United Power SHD/SHS/THD variants) are the SAME
-- physical machines already in mhr_records under 'Progressive Die Press' and
-- 'Tandem Press' -- identical machine_price_usd and Direct/Indirect OH
-- confirmed by direct query. All 16 are staged into sm_reference_data for a
-- lossless record (matching how every prior category stages its full source
-- regardless of cross-category duplication), but the promotion step's
-- existing by-name dedup (migration 564's own query, unmodified) will skip
-- all 12 automatically -- expect exactly 4 new mhr_records rows from this
-- migration, not 16.
--
-- The remaining 4 ('Standard Press - 1,500/3,000/5,000/7,000kN Press Force')
-- are genuinely new: same Direct/Indirect OH as the equivalent Progressive
-- Die Press / Tandem Press tonnage tier (a shared press-force-tier rate
-- convention across the whole Press/Forming family) but a DIFFERENT
-- machine_price_usd per tier -- a real, distinct category, matching
-- CLAUDE.md's own "Press/Forming family (Generic/Std/Tandem Press -- taxonomy
-- exists, unwired placeholders)" three-way split.
--
-- Taxonomy linking -- identity only, matching migration 572's own precedent:
-- process_calculator_mappings already has a real 'Std Press' operation
-- (Bending/Floating /Forming route) but is_active=false with machine_class
-- NULL (confirmed live, 2026-08-27). process_route/operation populated for
-- real, honest reporting; machine_class deliberately left NULL, same
-- discipline as migration 572's 2-Axis Router/Oxyfuel/Tandem Press rows and
-- migration 584's Plasma Punch row.
-- ============================================================================
